2026-09-03 | PERFORMANCE REVIEW

Measured build output (npm run build):
- application chunk: 34.67 kB / 12.06 kB gzip
- Three.js vendor chunk: 482.21 kB / 120.78 kB gzip
- CSS: 5.83 kB / 1.97 kB gzip
- selected runtime PBR texture bundle: 588,125 bytes
- texture map count: 10
- rooms: 5
- external complete GLB environments: 0
- skeletal animation clips: 0

Design controls:
- Three.js is separated into a vendor chunk.
- PBR sources were reduced from 2K to max 1024px before copying only required map families.
- Scene uses shared material instances and purpose-built primitive geometry.
- AABB collision avoids per-mesh trimesh/physics simulation.
- Two shadow-relevant lights max (one directional); practical point lights do not cast shadows.
- No random prop population, enemy AI, post-processing or dynamic global illumination.

Unmeasured due documented browser-binary blocker:
- browser FPS, draw calls, GPU texture memory and renderer.info at real runtime.
- Add these to final acceptance only after a real browser Playwright/manual run.
